{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03452",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 7.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Hmm, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.95,
      "end_seconds": 14.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "So, you're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.17,
      "end_seconds": 26.68,
      "duration_seconds": 11.51,
      "text": "yeah, it's flakes on my shoulders i don't know what's causing it i've been reading about it online and it worried me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.64,
      "end_seconds": 29.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Did it it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.62,
      "end_seconds": 39.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "I mean, probably five days. Yeah. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.51,
      "end_seconds": 43.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.42,
      "end_seconds": 55.89,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "I'd say mild. Oh, uh, and an itchy scalp. That's been about the same, about a month. And a little redness, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.83,
      "end_seconds": 62.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please. Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.33,
      "end_seconds": 77.16,
      "duration_seconds": 13.83,
      "text": "I take sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines. Seretide inhaler. I take it twice a day. I take an anti-dandruff shampoo, twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.87,
      "end_seconds": 80.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.71,
      "end_seconds": 87.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Two months now. I was on propranolol before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.42,
      "end_seconds": 105.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.85,
      "end_seconds": 109.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.51,
      "end_seconds": 114.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.27,
      "end_seconds": 117.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "my brother has epilepsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.81,
      "end_seconds": 122.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.72,
      "end_seconds": 139.98,
      "duration_seconds": 17.26,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I've never touched a cigarette. My partner and our baby. I hardly move around during the day. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.29,
      "end_seconds": 156.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.32,
      "end_seconds": 165.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "I've had migraines for about a year now. Asthma, for about a year. I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.61,
      "end_seconds": 168.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Alright, any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.79,
      "end_seconds": 174.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Alright, migraines and asthma, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.58,
      "end_seconds": 191.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.29,
      "end_seconds": 199.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Oh, yes, I had two stents put in my heart, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.5,
      "end_seconds": 201.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Nothing like pus?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.94,
      "end_seconds": 204.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Nope, no pus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.87,
      "end_seconds": 209.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Any hair loss, pain or rash elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.51,
      "end_seconds": 215.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "actually, no, no hair loss, pain or rash elsewhere"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.38,
      "end_seconds": 218.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.37,
      "end_seconds": 222.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.88,
      "end_seconds": 227.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.41,
      "end_seconds": 231.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "yes, um, that's fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.68,
      "end_seconds": 235.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.36,
      "end_seconds": 257.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "There is fine greasy scaling across the scalp with no bald patches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.58,
      "end_seconds": 270.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "Okay, all finished, thank you. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with simple dandruff."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.16,
      "end_seconds": 275.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.18,
      "end_seconds": 288.56,
      "duration_seconds": 12.38,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like simple dandruff. For this, ketoconazole shampoo, 2%, twice a week, four weeks. It's for dandruff."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.45,
      "end_seconds": 291.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Thank you, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.55,
      "end_seconds": 297.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Leave the shampoo on for five minutes before rinsing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.06,
      "end_seconds": 306.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "Sure. Come back if not better in a month. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.49,
      "end_seconds": 318.04,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "So, I take the ketoconazole shampoo, 2%, twice a week and come back if not better in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.97,
      "end_seconds": 324.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "So, yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.57,
      "end_seconds": 328.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.75,
      "end_seconds": 330.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}